{"availability":"available","full":"SiENcE/spellcast","name":"spellcast","description":"SpellCast is a PROTOTYPE of a fully decentralized, peer-to-peer Twitter-like application that runs entirely in your web browser. Share messages (called \"spells\") directly with your connections without relying on any central servers.","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":1,"forks":1,"created":"2025-03-28T12:16:45Z","updated":"2026-10-07T11:55:06Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":["browser","decentralized","javascript","p2p","p2p-chat","p2p-network","peerjs","peerjs-webrtc","secure","serverless","twitter-clone","webbrowser"],"demo":"https://sience.github.io/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T13:18:57.192Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T13:18:57.192Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T13:18:57.192Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T11:15:12.747Z","stars":1,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-09T13:18:57.192Z","stars":1,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Cast spells, not tweets. SpellCast is a Twitter-like social app with no servers, no sign-ups, and no company in the middle. Your messages (called \"spells\") travel directly between you and the people you connect with, and everything lives in your own browser. It's a single web page - nothing to install.","⚠️ SpellCast is an early prototype. It's a genuinely working, fun way to explore serverless social messaging - just don't rely on it for anything safety-critical yet. The honest details are in the technical notes.","Most social apps are free because you are the product. SpellCast takes the opposite approach:"],"features":["No servers, no middleman. There's no company database holding your posts. Messages go peer-to-peer, straight between browsers - nothing central to hack, sell, or shut down.","No sign-up, ever. No email, no phone number, no password. You pick a username, get an ID, and you're in.","Your data stays with you. Posts, images, and contacts live in your browser - not in someone else's cloud.","Private by design. No ads, no tracking, no profiling. Connections are encrypted in transit (WebRTC/DTLS), and messages only travel to people in your own network.","Works everywhere. Any modern desktop or mobile browser - iPhone, iPad, Android, laptop. Connect with a friend in seconds by scanning a QR code."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SiENcE/spellcast/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"deea6c52e59738a188bc2f13efc5b72462c021c81af69b81aaa8483d85885c89","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T11:15:12.886Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T11:15:12.886Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Cast spells, not tweets. SpellCast is a Twitter-like social app with no servers, no sign-ups, and no company in the middle. Your messages (called \"spells\") travel directly between you and the people you connect with, and everything lives in your own browser. It's a single web page - nothing to install.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SiENcE/spellcast/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Back up your key from Profile → Export Credential Backup (passphrase-encrypted) and restore it on another device from the login screen.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SiENcE/spellcast/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Your peer ID is still your network address and login for now; moving your credentials to another device is done via the encrypted credential backup — either the backup file, or Profile → Show Backup QR and Login → Scan Backup QR on the new device — rather than re-typing the ID.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SiENcE/spellcast/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"You can self-host the broker + TURN to keep that off third-party servers.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/SiENcE/spellcast/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"deea6c52e59738a188bc2f13efc5b72462c021c81af69b81aaa8483d8